  "details": "It shouldn't be possible for to hit someone with your mouse's raycast whilst you're on the quick menu and your mouse is outside the confines of the game window.\n\nThe repro is pretty easy, just go into a busy instance in windowed mode, put the game in a window then move your mouse outside the window whilst in the quick menu. The quick menu will update to show a user's details if you roll over them... despite the fact you're not even tabbed into the game!",
